 #### LeafNode
 Represents a voxel at the maximum depth of the octree that contains surface intersections [S1, unofficial].
 **Fields:**
-* Inherits all fields from `OctreeNode` and `QEFMixin`.
-* `float st[3]`: The starting corner (minimum coordinates) of the voxel.
-* `float len`: The side length of the voxel.
-* `int numint`: The number of edges intersected by the surface (0 to 12).
-* `float inters[12][3]`: The intersection points on the 12 edges.
-* `float norms[12][3]`: The surface normals at the intersection points.
